Subject: [PATCH] =?UTF-8?q?comms:=20Gmail-style=20tappable=20attachment=20?=
 =?UTF-8?q?in=20message=20list=20=E2=80=94=20open=20attachment=20directly?=
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Make the attachment paperclip (and a new count badge beside it) a tap
target in the collapsed message-list row: tapping it opens the message's
attachment directly, while tapping anywhere else on the row still opens
the message. Picks the first non-inline attachment (else the first);
reuses FairEmail's own open (Helper.share) and on-demand download
(EntityOperation.ATTACHMENT + ServiceSynchronize.eval). Applied to both
the normal and compact list layouts (include_message_{normal,compact}).
